{"2824320": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "AstroMart Adventures", "steam_appid": 2824320, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build a convenience store on an asteroid. Full immersive VR.<br>Gather ingredients, put them into machines and craft items your customers will love.<br>Unlock new areas like the merchant and mushroom biome.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Merchant offers you great machines and helpers to support you in your endevour.<br>They range from shelves to display your products, to machines like a slushy maker to craft delicious slushys.<br>Each machine is carefully designed with VR interaction as its main purpose.<br>Twiddle with knobs, attach gas bottles, smash buttons. Lots of interactive content.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >VR is programmed in a way so it is perfectly played while seating.<br>But of course, you can play this standing as well.<br>There is also a distance grab, so you don't need to bend down to pick something up if this is not your thing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You start small by selling stones, but soon you will whirl around the slushy maker and fire up the grill.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mushroom biome is the first unlockable biome, which offers more items and even a first small critter.<br>Which of course needs to be made into a recipe and sold to customers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can control demand by placing or removing items in shelves for customers to view.<br>What customers don't see, they won't buy, easy peasy.<br>Once you run out of items you can just shut down the store, and no new customers approach, so you can focus on getting the shelves stocked up.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build a convenience store on an asteroid. Full immersive VR.<br>Gather ingredients, put them into machines and craft items your customers will love.<br>Unlock new areas like the merchant and mushroom biome.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Merchant offers you great machines and helpers to support you in your endevour.<br>They range from shelves to display your products, to machines like a slushy maker to craft delicious slushys.<br>Each machine is carefully designed with VR interaction as its main purpose.<br>Twiddle with knobs, attach gas bottles, smash buttons. Lots of interactive content.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >VR is programmed in a way so it is perfectly played while seating.<br>But of course, you can play this standing as well.<br>There is also a distance grab, so you don't need to bend down to pick something up if this is not your thing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You start small by selling stones, but soon you will whirl around the slushy maker and fire up the grill.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mushroom biome is the first unlockable biome, which offers more items and even a first small critter.<br>Which of course needs to be made into a recipe and sold to customers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can control demand by placing or removing items in shelves for customers to view.<br>What customers don't see, they won't buy, easy peasy.<br>Once you run out of items you can just shut down the store, and no new customers approach, so you can focus on getting the shelves stocked up.</p>", "short_description": "Build a convenience store on an asteroid - Full immersive VR. Gather ingredients, put them into machines and craft items your customer will love.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2824320/0ec3c5b4ec055e6cbaedfe3d323af48a777d74b2/header.jpg?t=1763292451", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2824320/bef8c1b5cb8b732420a9f85ece6e4294de66e259/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1763292451", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2824320/bef